  {
   "id": "g14",
   "no": 14,
   "week": 4,
   "emoji": "📝",
   "title": "過去式（規則動詞）",
   "en": "past simple, regular verbs",
   "reuse": null,
   "intro": [
    {
     "h": "講已經發生嘅事",
     "p": "規則動詞過去式多數加 <b>-ed</b>。<br>以 e 結尾只加 d：revise → revised。",
     "ex": [
      [
       "I passed the test.",
       "我合格咗。"
      ],
      [
       "She studied Chinese yesterday.",
       "佢尋日溫中文。"
      ],
      [
       "We finished the project.",
       "我哋做完個專題。"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "否定同問句",
     "p": "過去式否定同問句用 <b>did</b>，動詞變返原形。<br>✅ I didn't pass.　❌ I didn't passed.<br>✅ Did you study? ",
     "ex": [
      [
       "Did you finish the worksheet?",
       "你做完工作紙未？"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
   "exercises": [
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "I ___ the quiz yesterday.",
     "zh": "我尋日合格咗個小測。",
     "o": [
      "passed",
      "pass",
      "passing",
      "passes"
     ],
     "a": 0,
     "why": "尋日已經發生，用 passed。"
    },
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "She didn't ___ the homework.",
     "zh": "佢冇做完功課。",
     "o": [
      "finish",
      "finished",
      "finishes",
      "finishing"
     ],
     "a": 0,
     "why": "did 後面用原形。"
    },
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "___ you study last night?",
     "zh": "你尋晚溫書未？",
     "o": [
      "Did",
      "Do",
      "Are",
      "Have"
     ],
     "a": 0,
     "why": "過去問句用 Did。"
    },
    {
     "t": "fill",
     "q": "We ___ the experiment.",
     "zh": "我哋做完個實驗。填 finished。",
     "a": [
      "finished"
     ],
     "why": "過去式加 -ed。"
    },
    {
     "t": "fill",
     "q": "He ___ not answer the question.",
     "zh": "佢冇答到條問題。填 did。",
     "a": [
